msgctxt "96"
msgid "Well, I'd say that went pretty well. At least she doesn't despise you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108"
msgid ""
"You stay out of this. And besides, what gives you the gumption to eavesdrop "
"on a man's private conversation?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid ""
"I've got it, Date-san. \"Nine Years of Love and Revenge: Former Detective "
"Saves the Life of a Local Beauty.\" Now is that not front page material or "
"what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid ""
"I say it's garbage material! Turning my personal life into a half-assed "
"attempt at an article... Gimme a break."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid ""
"Besides, who invited you here, anyway? And why are you\r\n"
"flapping your gums like you even know the half of it!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"Well, it was obvious something was up with you, so I simply followed along. "
"We journalists are always on the lookout for the latest and greatest⑬you "
"should know that by now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "Hey, Kiryu. You didn't spill the beans to this shmuck, did you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "...Who knows."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"Date-san... Aren't you a journalist yourself? It's fine that\r\n"
"you're proud to have been a detective, but show some spirit\r\n"
"for your current job, too! You'll be a much happier person!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Great, now I'm being lectured by this character..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "Know what, I'm done. It's time to go drinking! You guys coming or what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "You got 20,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "(I'm worried about Date-san and Mama. Where could they be...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "(Maybe I should get in touch with Date-san.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "(He's probably somewhere in the area. I'll take a look around.)"
msgstr ""

